@startuml Kiwi_Measurement_Chain
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #216875
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 24
title Proposed KiwiSDR measurement chain
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Known waveform\n+ expected frames" as Oracle
rectangle "Qualified RF\ntransmit station" as TX
rectangle "Kiwi A / B / C\nremote observers" as Kiwi
rectangle "Immutable originals\n+ capture metadata" as Store
rectangle "Versioned import\n48 kHz mono" as Import
rectangle "Rust decoder\nbaseline / candidate" as RX
rectangle "Exact-byte report\n+ exclusions" as Report
Oracle -right-> TX
TX -right-> Kiwi : HF
Kiwi -down-> Store : audio or IQ
Store -left-> Import
Import -left-> RX
RX -down-> Report
Oracle ..> Report : oracle
note bottom of Kiwi
Receive-only observations: no ACKs to
the transmitter.
Internet capture transport is not an
RF return path.
end note
@enduml
